      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "An example is pens draw when you hold them and the camera takes a picture every time you move it.\nAnother problem with this grab gesture is that the grab position of objects is right next to the wrist, so if you grab a pencil from far away it will go through the center of your hand. The default grab location with the current grab gesture should be in between the 2 fingers to feel more natural. This is how you would grab a pencil in real life with only the pinching motion. So in the image I would expect that the default grab position would be shifted up so it was in between my thumb and index finger.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "635ecd8b3c0cac450298b606",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5ee4be3aa4d9f33301f550e9",
        "alias": "Likely Yak",
        "aliasID": "65c28070ed6eefce4c542d22",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/ff48cf2cbcaf49bf4a11d9a23934f7d0.png",
        "created": "2020-06-13T11:53:30.473Z",
        "name": "-WildCat-",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2022-10-30T19:16:27.828Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "635c6e4ea9bb3e4851e68543",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with your suggestion for grabbing to require closing your pinky, ring, and middle finger. I also had that idea when I was thinking about this the other day, and I think it makes sense to leave the thumb and index finger free to do the pinch gesture to 'use' the object in hand.\nHowever, for objects that don't have any interaction event, I think it might be good to **also** allow people to grab those objects with a full-handed grab gesture (a fist basically).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
