  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-29T00:05:34.062Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nCurrently the only way to grab something is doing the pinch gesture. This comes with a few problems:\n1. Grabbing an object will also automatically fire the Interact Event.\n2. Pinching is not a natural gesture you would make to grab something.\n# Suggestion:\nGrabbing something should require you to close your hand (e.g. your small-, ring- and middle finger) and the pinching gesture should trigger the Interact Event.\nThis would make grabbing more natural and would prevent you from always triggering the Interact Event when trying to hold something.",
